/* ── Element spec (one line per drawn element) ───────────────────────────────
// target camera centre C2        → SphereGeometry(0.13)                 black
// target image plane l2          → 4 heavy cylinder edges (r .030) black + corner joints
//                                  + near-invisible white PlaneGeometry fill (depth/hit)
//                                  true 2.9 x 2.9 SQUARE, normal nearly horizontal
// target optical axis            → cylinder (r .015) black, C2 -> plane centre + 0.6*d2
// image point p                  → SphereGeometry(0.15) crimson + BackSide black rim
// back-projection ray C2 -> P    → dashed pool of cylinders (r .028) black
// scene point P                  → SphereGeometry(0.15) crimson + rim
// reference camera centre C1     → SphereGeometry(0.13)                 black
// reference image plane l1       → same square, yawed by R, translated by T
// reference optical axis         → cylinder (r .015) black
// image point p'                 → SphereGeometry(0.15) crimson (grey when out of FOV) + rim
